<title>FRANCE: France to offer 10 bln Ffr of T-bills Tuesday.</title>
<headline>France to offer 10 bln Ffr of T-bills Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French Treasury said on Thursday it would offer 10 billion francs of bills at its next weekly tender on Tuesday, April 1.</p>
<p>The offering will comprise seven billion francs of 13-week bills and three billion francs of 26-week paper.</p>
<p>Payment for both lines is due on April 3.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 42 21 54 52</p>
</text>
